## Output to the user
1. Detected stack and table library (one or two lines).
2. Root causes found (e.g. "flex child missing `min-width: 0`", "fixed 1200px table width").
3. Changes made, per file, and the table strategy chosen for each table and why.
4. Anything left for the user to decide (e.g. which columns are low-priority).
